#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/elogind.xml:320
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This package provides a Name Service Switch (NSS) module. Previously, a "
"Systemd-less system didn't have a dedicated NSS module used for better name "
"resolution, while Systemd systems have one that is tightly ingrained with "
"that software suite. Now, such a module is provided. In order to use it, the"
" <filename>/etc/nsswitch.conf</filename> file that was installed in LFS must"
" be altered. Overwrite the file as the &root; user:"
msgstr ""
"Esse pacote fornece um módulo Name Service Switch (NSS). Anteriormente, um "
"sistema sem Systemd não tinha um módulo NSS dedicado usado para melhor "
"resolução de nomes, enquanto sistemas Systemd têm um que está intimamente "
"integrado com essa suíte de software. Agora, tal módulo é fornecido. Para a "
"finalidade de usá-lo, o arquivo <filename>/etc/nsswitch.conf</filename> que "
"foi instalado no LFS precisa ser alterado. Sobrescreva o arquivo como o(a) "
"usante &root;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/elogind.xml:328
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/nsswitch.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\" &amp;&amp;\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/nsswitch.conf\n"
"\n"
"passwd: files elogind\n"
"group: files elogind\n"
"shadow: files elogind\n"
"\n"
"hosts: files dns\n"
"networks: files\n"
"\n"
"protocols: files\n"
"services: files\n"
"ethers: files\n"
"rpc: files\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/nsswitch.conf</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; /etc/nsswitch.conf &lt;&lt; \"EOF\" &amp;&amp;\n"
"<literal># Begin /etc/nsswitch.conf\n"
"\n"
"passwd: files elogind\n"
"group: files elogind\n"
"shadow: files elogind\n"
"\n"
"hosts: files dns\n"
"networks: files\n"
"\n"
"protocols: files\n"
"services: files\n"
"ethers: files\n"
"rpc: files\n"
"\n"
"# End /etc/nsswitch.conf</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/elogind.xml:347
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <literal>myhostname</literal>, <literal>mymachines</literal>, and "
"<literal>resolve</literal> NSS modules are still not provided (they come "
"from Systemd). The installed file cannot use them yet."
msgstr ""
"Os módulos NSS <literal>myhostname</literal>, <literal>mymachines</literal> "
"e <literal>resolve</literal> ainda não são fornecidos (eles vêm do Systemd)."
" O arquivo instalado ainda não consegue usá-los."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><note><para>
#: blfs-en/general/sysutils/elogind.xml:353
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"After completion of <application>elogind</application>, you should check "
"that it functions properly.  First ensure that "
"<application>dbus</application> is running.  It may be easiest to do this by"
" rebooting the system.  After logging in again, run the command "
"<command>loginctl</command>.  The result should indicate that a SESSION and "
"a SEAT have been created."
msgstr ""
"Depois da conclusão do <application>elogind</application>, você deveria "
"verificar se ele funciona corretamente. Primeiro, certifique-se de que "
"<application>dbus</application> esteja executando. Pode ser mais fácil fazer"
" isso reinicializando o sistema. Depois de se logar novamente, execute o "
"comando <command>loginctl</command>. O resultado deveria indicar que uma "
"SESSÃO e um SEAT foram criados."

